config BR2_PACKAGE_OCCULITED
	bool "occulited - the openccu-lite system service"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_GO_TARGET_ARCH_SUPPORTS
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_OPENCCU_BASE
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIGHTTPD
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIGHTTPD_LUA
	select BR2_PACKAGE_TCL
	help
	  The system service of openccu-lite: the metadata store
	  (device names, rooms, functions) with its API and change
	  stream, the system administration API and web UI, users
	  and sessions. It replaces the CCU WebUI and ReGaHss above
	  the XML-RPC line; the interface processes are untouched.

	  Installs the service, its lighttpd wiring (the /api and
	  shell proxy, the mod_magnet session gate for /addons/),
	  the busybox init script and the tclrega.so shim that
	  answers the session check of addon settings pages. Built
	  from a source archive of the occulited repository at a
	  pinned commit; the web UI is part of that archive, and so
	  is the addon catalogue the system carries (catalog/ of
	  that repository: the catalogue file and the adapter
	  manifests, installed under /etc/occulite).

	  https://github.com/hobbyquaker/occulited
